nt space on LEFT and RIGHT and AT LEAST 40px TOP and BOTTOM of EVERY figure. Fixed cell-local planted boot baseline y=338, consistent body center. Do not enlarge anything to fill cells. Never let umbrellas, tassels, fists, crowns or capes touch/overlap a neighboring figure or outside canvas edges. Leave very wide genuinely transparent gutters. All body parts and all prop parts fully visible, except torso may naturally be obscured by own open parasol during guard.\nALPHA: REAL transparent pixels outside the figures. No background color, gradient, scenery, floor, cast shadow, texture or printed checkerboard. No borders, grid, labels, numbers, words or watermark.\nABSOLUTELY CHARACTER AND PHYSICAL PARASOL ONLY: No effects of any kind: no aura, magic rings, umbrella needles/projectiles, rain droplets, beams, wind vortex, dust, particles, streaks, motion lines, blood, enemies or impact flashes. All spells will be separate Unity effect prefabs. Only the body pose, physical canopy/ribs/tassels and cape convey the action.\n",
